{
  "name": "gw-conn-large-frame",
  "about": "大帧与大请求体：基线的帧解析不设帧长上限（websocket.ts:107-148 只拒绝超过 Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER 的长度），一条约 16 MiB 的请求帧（describe_server 带一个大字段）照常应答，之后同一连接照常；/api/web/.../files/write 的请求体也不限大小（httpRouter.ts:132-143），约 4 MiB 的写入照常 200 并落盘，读回时超过 1 MiB 只给元数据（projectFiles.ts:162-170）。",
  "volatile": [
    "\\.http\\.headers\\.date$"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "raw": {
        "ws": true,
        "hello": true,
        "send": [
          {
            "frame": {
              "opcode": 1,
              "prefix": "{\"type\":\"request\",\"id\":\"big-1\",\"method\":\"describe_server\",\"params\":{\"pad\":\"",
              "text": "0123456789abcdef",
              "repeat": 1048576,
              "suffix": "\"}}"
            }
          },
          {
            "wait": 200
          },
          {
            "frame": {
              "opcode": 1,
              "json": {
                "type": "request",
                "id": "after-1",
                "method": "list_sessions",
                "params": {}
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "readMs": 4000
      }
    },
    {
      "raw": {
        "send": [
          {
            "prefix": "POST /api/web/projects/%2Fprivate%2Ftmp%2Fpdrs-bbx%2Froot%2Fproj/files/write HTTP/1.1\r\nHost: x\r\nAuthorization: Bearer {TOKEN}\r\nContent-Type: application/json\r\nContent-Length: 4194335\r\nConnection: close\r\n\r\n{\"path\":\"big.txt\",\"content\":\"",
            "text": "y",
            "repeat": 4194304,
            "suffix": "\"}"
          }
        ],
        "readMs": 3000
      }
    },
    {
      "http": "GET /api/web/projects/%2Fprivate%2Ftmp%2Fpdrs-bbx%2Froot%2Fproj/files/read?path=big.txt",
      "headers": {
        "authorization": "Bearer {TOKEN}"
      }
    }
  ]
}
